# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disaster recovery {#disaster-recovery}"
msgstr "Obnova po havárii {#disaster-recovery}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disaster recovery (DR) covers the steps required to restore IBM Quantum Compute Service to a working state after a regional failure or other major incident.\n"
msgstr "Obnova po havárii (DR) zahrnuje kroky potřebné k obnovení IBM Quantum Compute Service do funkčního stavu po regionálním selhání nebo jiném závažném incidentu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM responsibilities {#ibm-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Odpovědnosti IBM {#ibm-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM is responsible for the following disaster recovery tasks:\n"
msgstr "IBM odpovídá za následující úlohy obnovy po havárii:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restoring or rebuilding the provisioning environments and resources in the affected region.\n"
msgstr "Obnova nebo opětovné vybudování provisioningových prostředí a zdrojů v postiženém regionu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically recovering and restoring IBM Quantum Compute Service capabilities to normal operations following a regional or major incident.\n"
msgstr "Automatická obnova a navrácení schopností IBM Quantum Compute Service do běžného provozu po regionálním nebo závažném incidentu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your responsibilities {#your-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Tvoje odpovědnosti {#your-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a regional failure occurs, IBM recommends the following course of action.\n"
msgstr "Pokud dojde k regionálnímu selhání, IBM doporučuje následující postup.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Switch to an alternate region (recommended)**\n"
msgstr "**Přepni se do jiného regionu (doporučeno)**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your workload allows it, provision a new IBM Quantum Compute Service [instance](/guides/instances) in the alternate region and resubmit any impacted jobs there. This is the fastest path to resuming operations.\n"
msgstr "Pokud to tvoje úloha dovoluje, zřiď novou [instanci](/guides/instances) IBM Quantum Compute Service v jiném regionu a znovu tam odešli všechny dotčené úlohy. Je to nejrychlejší cesta k obnovení provozu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might not be able to switch regions if, for example:\n"
msgstr "Region možná nebudeš moci přepnout například tehdy, když:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your work requires specific qubit characteristics that are only available in the affected region.\n"
msgstr "Tvoje práce vyžaduje specifické vlastnosti qubitů, které jsou dostupné pouze v postiženém regionu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regulatory or data-residency requirements prevent you from using a different region.\n"
msgstr "Regulatorní požadavky nebo požadavky na umístění dat ti brání použít jiný region.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Wait for service recovery in your region**\n"
msgstr "**Počkej na obnovu služby ve svém regionu**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If switching regions is not an option, wait for IBM to recover the service in your region. IBM will communicate status and progress through the [IBM Cloud status page](https://cloud.ibm.com/status). After recovery is confirmed, resubmit any impacted jobs.\n"
msgstr "Pokud přepnutí regionu není možné, počkej, až IBM službu ve tvém regionu obnoví. IBM bude informovat o stavu a průběhu na [stavové stránce IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/status). Po potvrzení obnovy znovu odešli všechny dotčené úlohy.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional responsibilities {#additional-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Další odpovědnosti {#additional-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a full breakdown of IBM and customer responsibilities during a disaster recovery event, see [Disaster recovery](/guides/responsibilities#disaster-recovery) in the Responsibilities topic.\n"
msgstr "Úplný přehled odpovědností IBM a zákazníka během události obnovy po havárii najdeš v části [Obnova po havárii](/guides/responsibilities#disaster-recovery) v tématu Odpovědnosti.\n"
